@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam classBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
title Seven views — complementary questions, one coherent model
top to bottom direction
package "Structure" as ST {
 rectangle "03 Object-oriented\nConcepts + relationships" as O
 rectangle "05 Data-oriented\nInformation + authority" as D
 O -[hidden]right- D
}
package "Transformation" as TF {
 rectangle "04 Function-oriented\nInputs + functions + outputs" as F
}
package "Behavior" as BH {
 rectangle "06 Scenarios\nParticipant interaction" as S
 rectangle "07 States\nLifecycle + valid transitions" as T
 rectangle "08 Control flow\nOrder + synchronization" as A
 rectangle "09 Rules\nConditions + decisions" as R
 S -[hidden]right- T
 A -[hidden]right- R
 S -[hidden]down- A
}
rectangle "10 Constraints and operation contracts\nCompatible authority, effects and invariants" as C #17405A
ST .. C : structural consistency
TF .. C : functional consistency
BH .. C : behavioral consistency
note bottom of C
11: cross-view review and traceability.
12/13: interface and quality obligations.
14: qualified design handoff.
end note
legend bottom
Dashed undirected links connect groups of complementary views.
The views are not seven sequential phases or service calls.
endlegend
@enduml
